    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Linked list - merge</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/merge-two-sorted-lists/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 21</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Merge Two Sorted Lists</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A dummy head removes every \"is this the first node?\" check: compare the two fronts, splice the smaller one after tail, and when one list runs out attach the other in one step. O(m + n) time, O(1) extra space, no new nodes.</p>\n"
